{# Block 16: What Delivers — Premium — Balanced Spacing — Animation — Extra Content #}
<!-- impeccable-disable all-caps-body, tiny-text, tight-leading, numbered-section-labels -->
<section class="section-premium bg-[#f8f8f8]" data-anim="fade">
  <div class="container-wx">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-5" data-anim="left">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--wx-navy);">{{ eyebrow or 'What Woodex Delivers' }}</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3" style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.5rem); line-height:1.2;">{{ heading or 'One contract. One team. One result.' }}</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          {% for d in delivers or ['Space Planning — focus vs collaboration ratio','Concept & Materials — brand, product story, moodboard','3D Stills Approval — one per key room, in-house not render farm','BOQ & Cost Planning — budget with clarity, no fake sqft rate','Execution & Site Supervision — ISO 9001, mill connected to still','Furniture & Joinery — workstations, executive tables, reception, meeting, sofas','Handover & Snag — operational office'] %}
          <div class="flex gap-3" data-anim="up" data-delay="{{ loop.index }}">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#0f1e36] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[12px] flex-shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</span>
            <p class="text-[14px] leading-[1.5] text-[#111]">{{ d }}</p>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7" data-anim="right" data-delay="1">
        <div class="card-premium p-2 bg-white rounded-[24px]" data-tilt>
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-[16px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f8f8f8]">
            <img src="{{ deliverImage or '/images/studio-hero.jpg' }}" width="800" height="500" alt="{{ heading or 'Woodex delivers' }}" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <p class="text-[12px] tracking-wide uppercase font-semibold text-black/40">Mill connected to still — drawn, then made</p>
            <p class="text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#525252] mt-3">Plan first, then still — one still per key room — in-house not render farm — same still can go to BOQ and mill — 3D-only complete — BOQ optional — budget with clarity after approval — no fake sqft rate — size, scope, materials, MEP, furniture, timeline — plan holds number — DRAWN. THEN BUILT.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-[16px] bg-[#fcf2e8] border border-black/5"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide" style="color:var(--wx-navy);">No fake rate</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#525252] mt-2">Budget with clarity after you approve the room. BOQ turns still into buildable scope.</p></div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-[16px] bg-[#0f1e36] text-white"><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white/60">One PM accountable</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-white/70 mt-2">M-71 Zainab Tower, Model Town Link Road, Lahore — one PM accountable.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
